No domain mix improves Laptop14 OOD --- all fall within the baseline confidence interval (0.525$\pm$0.012). Adding all four DMASTE domains helps near-OOD (Rest15: 0.615, best) but not far-OOD. The home domain gives the best ID result (0.736, vocabulary overlap with restaurant). Adding diverse data helps within the same domain family but does not bridge the gap to a fundamentally different domain.

\subsection{Opinion Synonym Augmentation}

\begin{table}[htbp]
